  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">This contract is subject to Terms & Conditions, which are an integral part of the contract.</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">TERMS & CONDITIONS</h3>
  <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>Contractual Conditions:</li>
    <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <li>All rates are quoted in Indonesian Rupiah (IDR), based on per room per night, valid for single or double occupancy per room.</li>
      <li>Published rates are subject to 11% prevailing government tax & 10% service charge.</li>
      <li>Contract rates quoted are non-commissionable, inclusive of 11% prevailing government tax & 10% service charge, applicable strictly for the sole use of the Company.</li>
      <li>All reservations are subject to room's availability at the time of reservation or as per allotment agreement.</li>
      <li>Contract rates are applicable on your Company's account against the authorized Travel Agent Voucher.</li>
      <li>Should there be an extension of stay on guest's personal account, the best available rates shall apply subject to availability to protect the confidentiality of this agreement.</li>
    </ul>
    <li>Extra Bed Policy</li>
    <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <li>Extra bed is available for all room categories at IDR 500,000 nett per night. Rate is inclusive of 11% prevailing government tax & 10% service charge. Limited to a maximum of one extra bed per room.</li>
      <li>Baby cots are available to be provided at no cost to a maximum of one cot per room.</li>
    </ul>
  </ul>

