  <h3 class="section-title">CHILDREN POLICY</h3>
  <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>Accommodation is free of charge for children up to 11.99 years of age sharing the same room with parents and using existing bedding or using a complimentary baby cot. Should additional bedding be required, extra bed rates will apply.</li>
    <li>Complimentary all meals at available restaurant for children up to 3 years old when accompanying an adult who is having a full paying meal.</li>
    <li>50% discount on all contracted meal will apply for children from 3 to 11.99 years old when accompanying an adult who is having a full paying meal.</li>
    <li>Children occupying their own room sold at contracted rates will be charged full contract rate for accommodation and breakfast or other products and services packaged with accommodation.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="section-title">RESERVATION PROCEDURES</h3>
  <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>All reservations have to be submitted within 48 hours upon receipt and are subject to availability or allotment agreement.</li>
    <li>Reservations shall not be binding until written acceptance and confirmation has been received from the Resort.</li>
    <li>A change of name is considered a cancellation and re-booking and is subject to availability at the time of name change.</li>
    <li>In order for us to provide personalized service and ensuring the implementation of personal preference services to all our guests, information on guest profile including phone number and email address is required to be submitted to the Resort for all bookings made.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="section-title">CHECK IN AND CHECK OUT</h3>
  <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>Check in time is 14:00 hours. Check out time is 12:00 hours.</li>
    <li>Guaranteed late check out can only be confirmed prior to arrival by the payment of one (1) night charge at the contracted rate.</li>
    <li>Late Check Out to 18:00 hours will incur additional charge of 50% based on contracted rate. Check out after 18.00 hours will incur additional one (1) night charge. And subject to availability.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="section-title">SPLIT SEASON</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Rates will be identified based on seasonal dates above. Should any booking fall over two seasons, a split season rate offering will be permitted.</p>

