  <h3 class="section-title">BILLING PROCEDURES</h3>
  <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>Pursuant to Bank Indonesia regulation effective 1 July 2015, all payments shall be made in Rupiah currency and therefore all of our quoted US Dollar amount shall be automatically converted into Rupiah amount using our current bookkeeping rate.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="section-title">PAYMENT</h3>
  <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>Reservations will only be accepted with full pre-payment for non-credited companies unless credit facilities established with Resort's Financial Controller.</li>
    <li>For Company with approved credit facilities, the Resort will send a statement of account, and settled by the Company in full, without producing consent from guests, received within thirty (30) days after tender of invoice.</li>
    <li>The Resort reserves the right to withdraw credit facilities provided, subject to Company's prevailing credit standing with the Resort, without prejudice to the rest of terms herein.</li>
    <li>Corporate credit cards are accepted for deposit payment or settlement of account.</li>
    <li>All payment of reservations should be sent to the following Bank Account details:</li>
    <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <li>Beneficiary: PT. PLATARAN INDONESIA</li>
      <li>Bank Name: Bank Central Asia (BCA)</li>
      <li>Bank Address: KCP Melawai, Jalan Melawai Raya 165 Blok C1 - 3, Jakarta 12160</li>
      <li>IDR A/C No.: 546-039-6168</li>
      <li>Swift Code: CENAJDA</li>
    </ul>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="section-title">BOOKING HONOUR</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">In the event the Resort are unable to honour a booking by providing accommodation within the Resort, then the Resort shall provide alternative accommodation in another Resort of the same category. In such a case, the Resort shall be deemed to have fulfilled its obligations and shall be exonerated from any liability for breach of contract.</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">CLOSEOUT DATE</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Notwithstanding any provision of this Agreement, in the event that the Resort is unable to honour its allocations due to incentive, group booking or high demand, the Resort shall email/fax the International wholesalers or the local travel agent, advising the International wholesalers that in respect of a specific period of time, all bookings made after the announcement of the close out date shall be on request basis only.</p>

